# Mischievous Mystic: "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 1/1 blue Faerie creature token with flying" (CR 121.2, 603.2). In Bot2's
# upkeep on turn 2 Bot1 casts its own Ancestral Recall (an instant): those are Bot1's first three cards that turn, and the second makes one Faerie.
# On turn 3 the count starts again and the draw step's card is only the first: still one Faerie.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mischievous Mystic
Ancestral Recall
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Mischievous Mystic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mischievous Mystic; Mox Sapphire; Faerie Token
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mischievous Mystic; Mox Sapphire; Faerie Token
